                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kalo ele olotu eing'uaa Edom, oishopito ilkilani oonyokie ooing'uaa Bosara, kalo ilo olotu eishopo ilkilani le nkitoo, olotu te nkitoo o te ngolon? “Nanu ilo oibalunye esipata, Olmagilani oitajeusho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kainyoo pee enyokioo ilkilani linono, neikununo ilkilani linono anaa ile, ilo olo aim eneironyieki isabibu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.14.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 14.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Aitunyo nanu enkironyet oo sabibu openy, ore too ltung'ana nemetii hoo obo otaa te nebo nanu; naitunyoo nanu ninche te ngoro ai naitame nanu ninche te mpushuna ai; ore ilo sarge lenye neisuakino ilkilani laainei, naidurukie nanu ilkilani laainei pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu etii apa ina olong e lap atua oltau lai, ore ilo ari lai le nkordunoto netabaua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.59.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 59.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aing'ura nanu, kake meetae hoo obo laaretu, naing'asia amu meetae hoo obo laatijing'a enkoriong, neaku te nkaina ai ake anoto enkishuroto, naaitasheyie nanu empushuna ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aitunyoyie nanu olorere te ngoro ai, naitemer nanu ninche te ngoro ai napi, nabukoki nanu osarge lenye enkop.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esupatisho o Laitoriani ti alo Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kalimu nanu ina nyorrata o Laitoriani nauno, ina kisisa o Laitoriani, te risioroto e nena pooki naaishoo iyiook Olaitoriani, o ina supatisho kitok te nkaji e Israel, apa naishoo ninye ninche terisioroto o lng'ur lenye, te risioroto e ina kitoo e nyorrataenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu etejo ninye, Esipa iltung'ana laainei ninche, nkera aainei nemeeta elejare; netaa ninye Olaitajeunoni lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore to losilisili lenye pooki, neisilisiloki ninye, naa ilo malaika otii te nebo ninye oitajeuo ninche; te nyorrata enye o to lng'ur lenye eitajeuo ninye ninche; etudumua ninye ninche nenap ninche nkolong'i pooki ti apa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etogolong'utua ninche nepik osina Enkiyang'et enye sinyati; neaku eibelekenye ninye aaku olmang'atinta lenye, ore ninye openy negilunore ninche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ninye adamu nkolong'i e apa moitie, e Musa ilo sinka lenye. Koree ilo apa oyaua ailepunye te naiposha lelo shekuti loo nkerrai enyena? Koree ilo opik atua ninche enkiyang'et enye sinyati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 14.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ilo oisho ina aina enye e nkitoo meshomo te nkaina e tatene e Musa, ilo apa otooro nkariak te dukuya ninche, pee eitobiraki kewan enkarna oo ntarasi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kaing'ae otorikoyie ninche aimie ine negut? Anaa embarta naimita olpurkel, eitu apa ninche errorro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anaa nkishu naadoyio aapuo oerata, eishoo ninche Enkiyang'et o Laitoriani enkiyeng'iyeng'ata. Neaku itorikoyie apa iyie iltung'ana linono, pee intobiraki kewan enkarna e nkitoo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkomono te nkaraki olng'ur o eretoto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ura kop te shumata toduaa, te ine wueji ino e nkitoo nesinya. Koree olokiyo lino o enkidimata ino? Ore eyieunoto ino o lng'ur lino neiboori te nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ira iyie Papa lang, hoo nemeyiolo iyiook Abraham nemelimu iyiook Israel; ore iyie, Lo Aitoriani, ira Papa lang, ore enkarna ino, Olokordu iyiook ebaiki apa moitie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olaitoriani, kainyoo iyie pee ncho iyiook matapaash nkoitoi inono nintagol iltauja lang metaa mikiure iyie? Torrinyunye te nkaraki isinkan linono, lelo oshon le njung'ore ino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo tung'ana linono sinyat netujung'o enkaji ino sinyati te nkiti rishata; neitunyo ilmang'ati lang ina aji ino sinyati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
